// Golden-scenario model-extensie — the casus-omission the golden set needs on top of
// examples/toka-reconciliation/casus-omissies.rgs, which lists the five omissions of the
// casus's own rules (docs/historical/grammar-divergences.md, "TOKA casus omissions"). Both
// are companions of every line of examples/toka-scenarios/manifest and part of the TOKA
// model foundation that `make facts`, FactModelCliTest
// (toolchain/src/test/java/dev/uchar/regelspraak/toolchain/cli/FactModelCliTest.java) and
// the service's TOKA set (service/src/test/java/dev/uchar/regelspraak/toolchain/service/TokaSource.java)
// load.
//
// toka-26 "Hoogseizoen" assigns the kenmerk "in het hoogseizoen" to a Vlucht, but the
// casus object model (toka-02) never declares it — exactly the kind of undeclared member
// examples/toka-reconciliation supplies for other rules. Without the declaration the
// scenario of toka-26 does not resolve ("het objecttype 'Vlucht' kent geen kenmerk 'in het
// hoogseizoen'").
Extensie van objecttype de Vlucht
    is in het hoogseizoen kenmerk (bijvoeglijk);
